=== Encoding Analysis ===
sizeof(wchar_t) = 4 bytes
L"VfL" in memory (hex):
  demo[0] = 0x00000056 ('V')
  demo[1] = 0x00000066 ('f')
  demo[2] = 0x0000004C ('L')
  demo[3] = 0x00000000 (null terminator)
Interpretation: UTF-32 encoding (Linux/Unix)

Test 1: L"VfL" literal
Result: |VfL|

Test 2: wchar_t array with L'x' literals
Result: |VfL|

Test 3: wchar_t array with 'x' literals (bad practice)
Result: |VfL|

Test 4: Empty L"" literal
Result: ||

Test 5: Longer ASCII string
Result: |Hello World|

All tests completed successfully!
